SUMMARY:Yoga In Nature™\, Gratitude Yoga Flow\, ALL LEVELS YOGA\, NCMA
DESCRIPTION:Yoga In Nature™\, NC\n**THIS IS THE GRATITUDE YOGA FLOW THAT
  WAS POSTPONED (DUE TO RAIN ON THURSDAY\, 11/26). JOIN US UNDER THE SUN ON
  SATURDAY 11/28 AT 10AM.**\n**Join Yoga In Nature™ for the annual "Grati
 tude" Thanksgiving morning yoga event!!!**\n**ALL LEVELS\, including first
  timers\, welcome**. ***NOTE: SHOULD WE GET RAIN FOR THIS MORNING 11/26 AN
 D CLASS BE CANCELED\, IT WILL BE RESCHEDULED FOR SATURDAY\, 11/28 AT THIS 
 SAME LOCATION. I WILL POST SEPARATELY FOR SIGNUPS\, IF NEEDED:)***\nJoin u
 s on Thanksgiving morning for a vinyasa flow to yin practice ending in sav
 asana as we explore "gratitude" the theme this month. Feel free to stay fo
 r hot tea and community gathering following class. **Bring a friend or fam
 ily member and let them enjoy the experience of yoga outdoors\, in nature:
 )**\nPractice vinyasa flow yoga at North Carolina Museum of Art\, outdoors
  near upper parking area in grass ellipse... (NOTE THIS GRASS LOCATION\, a
 s there are other groups that use NCMA grounds). WHEN YOU COME INTO THE PA
 RKING LOT\, DRIVE TO WHERE THE TWO PARKING LOTS ON BLUE RIDGE MEET\, AWAY 
 FROM THE MUSEUM. We practice in the grass Ellipse area:) **$15/person. NOT
 E: if you have 4+ people in your group\, message me for special family pri
 cing.**\nCash\nVenmo @Darlene-Genander\nPaypal dgenander@yogainnature.com\
 naccepting Zelle\n\nCome flow with us! Bring a mat\, towel or plastic line
 r to protect your mat if ground is damp\, water\, and anything the you use
  for your practice. Recommend wearing layers as we get into the cooler mon
 ths. We will begin in a seated meditation\, then vinyasa flow practice to 
 yin\, ending in savasana. Meet others\, make friends in our yoga community
 .
